WEBVTT - Class 1 English Mridang Chapter 2: Greetings

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:45.000
<v Teacher Tara>Look outside! The sun is peeking over the green hills with warm golden rays. We greet the new day with a smile: Good morning!

00:00:45.000 --> 00:01:30.000
<v Teacher Tara>Milo arrives at the Gurukula gate. He joins his hands gently and bows with respect: Namaste, Acharya ji!

00:01:30.000 --> 00:02:15.000
<v Teacher Tara>Here comes Tara with her blue backpack! Milo waves cheerfully: "Hello Tara, how are you today?" Tara smiles: "I am well, thank you!"

00:02:15.000 --> 00:03:00.000
<v Teacher Tara>When the golden sun rests and twinkling stars appear in the dark blue sky, we whisper: Good night, sleep tight!

